{"id":45,"mal_id":45,"title":"Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan","englishTitle":"Rurouni Kenshin","title_english":"Rurouni Kenshin","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Samurai X","Wandering Kenshin: Romantic Tales from the Meiji Era"],"en":"Rurouni Kenshin","ja":"るろうに剣心 -明治剣客浪漫譚-"},"synopsis":"In the final years of the Bakumatsu era lived a legendary assassin known as Hitokiri Battousai. Feared as a merciless killer, he was unmatched throughout the country, but mysteriously disappeared at the peak of the Japanese Revolution. It has been ten peaceful years since then, but the very mention of Battousai still strikes terror into the hearts of war veterans.\n\nUnbeknownst to them, Battousai has abandoned his bloodstained lifestyle in an effort to repent for his sins, now living as Kenshin Himura, a wandering swordsman with a cheerful attitude and a strong will. Vowing never to kill again, Kenshin dedicates himself to protecting the weak. One day, he stumbles across Kaoru Kamiya at her kendo dojo, which is being threatened by an impostor claiming to be Battousai. After receiving help from Kenshin, Kaoru allows him to stay at the dojo, and so the former assassin temporarily ceases his travels.\n\nRurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan tells the story of Kenshin as he strives to save those in need of saving. However, as enemies from both past and present begin to emerge, will the reformed killer be able to uphold his new ideals?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En los últimos años de la era Bakumatsu vivió un asesino legendario conocido como Hitokiri Battousai. Temido como un asesino despiadado, no tenía rival en todo el país, pero desapareció misteriosamente en el apogeo de la Revolución Japonesa. Han pasado diez años de paz desde entonces, pero la sola mención de Battousai todavía infunde terror en los corazones de los veteranos de guerra.\n\nSin que ellos lo sepan, Battousai ha abandonado su estilo de vida manchado de sangre en un esfuerzo por arrepentirse de sus pecados, y ahora vive como Kenshin Himura, un espadachín errante con una actitud alegre y una fuerte voluntad. Kenshin promete no volver a matar nunca más y se dedica a proteger a los débiles. Un día, se topa con Kaoru Kamiya en su dojo de kendo, que está siendo amenazado por un impostor que dice ser Battousai. Después de recibir ayuda de Kenshin, Kaoru le permite quedarse en el dojo, por lo que el ex asesino cesa temporalmente sus viajes.\n\nRurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan cuenta la historia de Kenshin mientras se esfuerza por salvar a aquellos que necesitan ser salvados. Sin embargo, a medida que comiencen a surgir enemigos del pasado y del presente, ¿podrá el asesino reformado defender sus nuevos ideales?\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1500,"average_episode_duration":1500,"startDate":"1996-01-10","start_date":"1996-01-10","endDate":"1998-09-08","end_date":"1998-09-08","season":"winter","year":1996,"start_season":{"year":1996,"season":"winter"},"episodes":94,"num_episodes":94,"score":8.27,"mean":8.27,"numListUsers":530533,"num_list_users":530533,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":4,"name":"Comedy"},{"id":13,"name":"Historical"},{"id":22,"name":"Romance"},{"id":21,"name":"Samurai"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"}],"studios":[{"id":36,"name":"Gallop"},{"id":37,"name":"Studio Deen"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/119505.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/119505l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/119505.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/119505l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/119505l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"wednesday","time":"19:30","day_of_the_week":"wednes